# Approved release-signer fingerprint (Packet 8K-P signing contract).
#
# Copy this file to config/release-signer.fingerprint and put the FULL
# 40-hex-character GPG fingerprint of the operator's approved release key on
# the single line, OR set the RELEASE_SIGNER_FINGERPRINT environment variable.
#
# The certification only treats a detached signature as SIGNED when gpg
# reports a VALIDSIG whose fingerprint EXACTLY equals this value. Short key
# IDs are never trusted. A valid signature from any other key is
# UNTRUSTED_SIGNER and blocks the release.
#
# Example (REPLACE with the real fingerprint, never commit a real key):
# A1B2C3D4E5F60718293A4B5C6D7E8F9012345678